<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Patterson EPS view raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Patterson EPS view raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Barrington Research Associates Inc said Friday it raised its earnings-per-share estimates on Patterson Dental Co to $1.55 from $1.48 for FY97 ending April 30 and to $1.77 from $1.73 for FY98.</p>
<p>-- Analyst Debra O'Shea in a report noted that the dental supply company posted strong third-quarter results.</p>
<p>-- &quot;The shares continue to provide a return on equity of over 20 percent and strong double-digit earnings growth,&quot; O'Shea said.</p>
<p>-- Patterson was trading up 1/8 at 32-3/4.</p>
<p>	     ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
</text>
